{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A year after Maggie\u2019s wild encounter in the forest, everything changed.</strong><br>She became a werewolf, not from a bite, but from raw, untamed sex. Her story went viral, and now hundreds of women are willingly venturing into the woods, hoping to experience the same wild transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Michael</strong>, an alpha werewolf with one mission from the Elders:<br><strong>Mate with 300 women to save your species.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But danger is close.<br><strong>The Hunters</strong> have caught wind of this new evolution. Fanatical and armed, they\u2019ve entered the forest with one goal: <strong>slaughter every last werewolf</strong> before the &quot;infection&quot; spreads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AlphaFurry 2</strong> is a unique blend of <strong>visual novel</strong> and <strong>2D action platformer</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each time you find a girl, you\u2019re rewarded with a private moment: a high-resolution erotic image. But there\u2019s a catch, the image is shattered into puzzle pieces. To relive the scene, you\u2019ll need to <strong>reconstruct it piece by piece</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzles are simple but satisfying, designed to let you focus on the real prize: fully uncensored artwork full of detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to fuck your way into legend?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824600?t=1752509916","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824600?t=1752509916","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824600/e444ccb5cedd293b029a58c38105af9ee2fa1b82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752509916","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_